# Muelle de Dinamo (the docks of Puerto Dinamo, C3, contract 34), 26 x 22. column = i, row = j. The town (puerto_dinamo) arrives at the north edge. Look (the user's mock "Puerto Dinamo"): the quay of light concrete
# slabs with its painted safety line, stacked containers, the DOCK CRANE, crates, barrels and bollards, net racks and lobster traps, harbour lamps; the boardwalk (row 13) and the bay (animated sea, foam on its
# north bank, rows 14..21) with the FERRY ALBATROS moored in it (an NPC hidden by flag 53 when it departs, with its gangway). The sailor and the step trigger X (10,12) check the Ferry Pass (key item)
# before the hero walks up the gangway.
@map muelle_dinamo
@size 26 22
@interior no
@area puerto_dinamo
@bg 0
@fill quay
@spawn north 12 1 S             # arriving from the town
@spawn quay 10 11 N             # back from the ferry: in front of the gangway
@flag ferry_gone 53             # the ferry has departed (hides it and its gangway)
@var tmp 9                      # has_item result
@legend
  .  tile=quay                     # light concrete in big slabs (2 variants)
  P  tile=quay_s                   # the painted safety line
  d  tile=quay_n                   # the boardwalk along the quay edge, water to its south (2 variants)
  o  tile=quay_n object=bollard
  H  object=crate_plain
  x  object=barrel
  T  object=crate_stack
  t  object=trap
  l  object=lamp_s                 # harbour lamp
  n  tile=quay
  K  object=container
  R  object=crane
  N  object=net_rack
  S  object=sign interact=look text=muelle.sign
  s  object=sign interact=look text=muelle.ferry.sign
  r  tile=sea_tr                   # the bay (animated sea, 2 frames; the north bank)
  w  tile=sea_o
  F  tile=sea_tr object=blank npc=ferry id=ferry hide_flag=53 text=puerto.ferry
  Y  tile=quay_n npc=gangway id=gang hide_flag=53 solid=no text=puerto.gangway
  X  interact=step script=board
  A  npc=marinero id=sailor face=W script=sailor
  a  npc=vecino_m id=fisher face=SW text=muelle.npc
@grid
  HHxHHHxHHHxHnnxHHHxHHHxHHH
  H............P...........H
  H...........SP...........H
  H..........l.P.l.........H
  H..KKKT......P...........H
  H.HKKKH......P.....KKK...H
  H............P.....KKKH..H
  H............P...........H
  H.x.....x....P...........H
  H..NN.t......P........R..H
  H............P...........H
  H...l....l...P...l......xH
  H.........XA..s.a........H
  ddddodddddYdddddodddodddod
  rrrrrrrrrrrFrrrrrrrrrrrrrr
  wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww
  wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww
  wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww
  wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww
  wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww
  wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww
  wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww
@warp n -> puerto_dinamo spawn=south
# Boarding: stepping on the gangway's foot needs the Ferry Pass; with it the hero walks up the gangway and the Ferry Albatros' deck loads; after the
# departure (flag 53) the ferry is gone and so is the way.
@script board step
    jf ferry_gone gone
    has_item ferry_pass tmp
    jv tmp 1 ok
    npc_face_hero sailor
    say puerto.board.nopass
    hero_walk NE 1
    end
  ok:
    npc_face_hero sailor
    say puerto.board.ok
    hero_walk SW 3
    warp ferry_cubierta spawn=gangway
    end
  gone:
    say puerto.board.gone
    hero_walk NE 1
@end
@script sailor npc
    npc_face_hero sailor
    jf ferry_gone gone
    say puerto.sailor
    end
  gone:
    say puerto.sailor.gone
@end
